# Sparkle: SELECT held on the Garden. Off in every recipe; with the piece; gone with the recipe. A project from the
# colors' build (format 7) keeps its chords, Sparkle off.
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
expect par42 0
press SEL
wait 100
shot off.png
spin K1 4
expect par42 4
spin K2 -6
expect par43 50
spin K3 2
expect par44 46
wait 100
shot on.png
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 0
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par42 4
expect par43 50
expect par44 46
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par42 0
expect par43 56
expect par44 44
storev7 13
reboot
wait 300
expect par28 13
expect par42 0
expect par43 56
expect par44 44
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par28 13
